# Estate write-freshness / hygiene intent is comp-heat's analytic (cold-subtree clustering +
# git write-history), NOT a text find -- force it above a co-occurring search/list verb so
# "FIND dead directories" / "WHAT FILES are stale + safe to archive" route to comp-heat, not grep.
