    r"\b(safe to archive|archive candidates?|cold subtrees?|dead director(y|ies)|"
    r"stale (files?|dirs?|directories)|repo hygiene|estate hygiene|"
    r"writes? not (in a |)commit(ted)?|uncommitted (writes?|changes?|work)|"
    r"what have i written|written but not committed)\b", re.IGNORECASE)

# Text-search intent: a verb that means "find this string/symbol in the repo" -- the cases
# with NO rich tool, where comp-which must RUN the on-rails primitive instead of dead-ending.
